==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Brollow]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Brollow and Zollow are most threatening when they act as support for other enemies or are spammed, but they sure don't have either of those here. Bringing a unit with a fair amount of damage to prevent excessive Brollow rebounds is recommended. Breakerblast can clean up Zollow corpses easily.

